Serve the OpenScience web workspace under a path prefix (reverse proxy).

The workspace assumed it owned the origin root: absolute /assets URLs,
router paths and API routes all started at /. Behind the CANFAR Studio
proxy it lives at /session/contrib/<id>/openscience/. The proxy sets
window.__OPENSCIENCE_BASE_URL__ to that mount from a same-origin script
loaded before the app (the CSP forbids inline scripts); the router,
default server URL and API routes follow it. A same-origin trusted proxy may also enable
the terminal, which is otherwise loopback-only.

Build with OPENSCIENCE_WEB_BASE=./ so index.html uses relative assets.
Applies to synthetic-sciences/openscience v2.0.143.
